{"type":"FlowTopic","triggers":[{"type":"Trigger","name":"a4c35bfe28824d069ca6436ff529e4bb","triggerType":"request","applicability":{"type":"Applicability","mode":"script","value":"true"},"id":"a4c35bfe28824d069ca6436ff529e4bb"}],"goals":[{"name":"primary","trigger_id":"a4c35bfe28824d069ca6436ff529e4bb","nodes":[{"type":"StartGoal","goal_id":"primary","greeting_msg":{"type":"String","mode":"string","value":""},"id":"f16955ef9e724edb9417999db2bd353b","name":"Start","expert_mode":false},{"type":"TerminateGoal","goal_id":"primary","confirmation_msg":{"type":"String","mode":"string","value":""},"id":"a2ee8aecd3184254b755fb5bc409adf4","name":"End","expert_mode":false},{"type":"LibraryCall","library_topic_name":"AI Output","library_topic_id":"fc4c14b2431cc21006650464dbb8f2a9","library_topic_is_template":false,"parameter-mappings":[{"parameter-name":"definition","value":{"type":"String","mode":"script","value":"(function execute() {
 var config = {
 configuration: {"description":"{{0}}"}
 };
 return JSON.stringify(config);
 })()"},"metadata":{"type":"String","list":false,"items":[],"use_items":false}},{"parameter-name":"inputs","metadata":{"type":"String","list":true,"items":[{"type":"String","mode":"string","value":"Success! 🎉 A new badge has been assigned successfully. You're all set to use your badge!"}],"use_items":true}}],"return-value-mappings":[],"header_card_fields":[],"input_parameters_mode":"dynamic","output_parameters_mode":"dynamic","id":"1075fc19c99447d3b0e46f6f472f3551","name":"Assign Response","goal_id":"primary","applicability":{"type":"Applicability","mode":"script","value":"true"},"expert_mode":false},{"type":"ScriptedAction","script":"(function execute() {
 //badge type
 if(null!=vaInputs.badge_type && ""!=vaInputs.badge_type){
 vaVars.badge_type= vaInputs.badge_type;
 }

 var idenlocationGr = new GlideRecordSecure('x_aleen_snguardian_identity_location')
 idenlocationGr.addQuery('identity',vaInputs.user_sys_id);
 idenlocationGr.query();
 var location = "";
 if(idenlocationGr.next()){
 location = idenlocationGr.location;
 vaVars.user_location = location;
 gs.info("Location : "+location);
 }

 //get location Mobile Cred Config
 var dtInputs = {};
 dtInputs.user_location = vaVars.user_location;
 var result = new GuardianAIAgentHelper().getDTConfigs("a57ddb4833083650bf1221382e5c7b7e",dtInputs);
 gs.info("DT Result Mob Cred : "+JSON.stringify(result));
 vaVars.location_mobile_cred_enabled = "true";
})()
","id":"c11a799b86594182b747ec8d0974ff70","name":"Get User Location & Location Config","goal_id":"primary","applicability":{"type":"Applicability","mode":"script","value":"true"},"expert_mode":false},{"type":"ScriptedAction","script":"(function execute() {
 var dtInputs = {};
 dtInputs.user_location = vaVars.user_location;
 dtInputs.user_type = vaInputs.user_type_sys_id;
 dtInputs.badge_type = vaVars.agent_input_badge_type;
 dtInputs.badge_action = "assign";
 var result = new GuardianAIAgentHelper().getDTConfigs("0d37c78833843650bf1221382e5c7bc7",dtInputs);
 gs.info("DT Result : "+JSON.stringify(result));
// {
// "SUB_TYPE": "",
// "VALID_FROM": "CURRENT",
// "VALID_TO": "PROMPT",
// "DEFAULT_ACCESS": "true",
// "APPROVAL": "false",
// "DEACTIVATE_EXISTING": "false",
// "COPY_ACCESS": "false",
// "DEFAULT_STATUS": "2a7f0ed51bbc8210759455342a4bcbe9",
// "ASSIGNMENT_TYPE": "Auto",
// "SYS_ID": "2c4b76f22bf72e10d4dffd74ce91bfd0"
// }
 if(result['VALID_FROM']=="CURRENT"){
 vaVars.valid_from = new GlideDateTime().getDisplayValue();
 }
 if(result['VALID_TO']=="PROMPT"){
 vaVars.ask_valid_to = "true";
 }
 vaVars.default_status = result.DEFAULT_STATUS;

 //default system
 var locationAdminGr = new GlideRecordSecure('x_aleen_snguardian_badge_office');
 locationAdminGr.addQuery('locationsLIKE'+location);
 locationAdminGr.orderBy('order');
 locationAdminGr.query();
 if(locationAdminGr.next()){
 vaVars.default_system = locationAdminGr.system;
 }

 //default access
 if(location && result.DEFAULT_ACCESS && result.DEFAULT_ACCESS=="true"){
 var accessList = [];
 var accessLocationGr = new GlideRecordSecure('x_aleen_snguardian_access_location');
 accessLocationGr.addQuery('location', location);
 accessLocationGr.addQuery('is_default', true);
 accessLocationGr.query();
 while (accessLocationGr.next()) {
 var accessLevel = accessLocationGr.access_level.toString(); // Convert to string
 if (accessList.indexOf(accessLevel) === -1) {
 accessList.push(accessLevel);
 }
 }
 vaVars.default_access = accessList.join(); 
 }
})()
","id":"4714693e19b843dfa3edff4a07f9f956","name":"get DT Badge Config","goal_id":"primary","applicability":{"type":"Applicability","mode":"script","value":"true"},"expert_mode":false}],"edges":[{"type":"Edge","source_node_id":"1075fc19c99447d3b0e46f6f472f3551","target_node_id":"a2ee8aecd3184254b755fb5bc409adf4","id":"3d9ae4c2e5d74bd1b134e41e35c0aad7"},{"type":"Edge","source_node_id":"f16955ef9e724edb9417999db2bd353b","target_node_id":"c11a799b86594182b747ec8d0974ff70","id":"cae390e092c44358a1ca2176aa50760d"},{"type":"Edge","source_node_id":"c11a799b86594182b747ec8d0974ff70","target_node_id":"4714693e19b843dfa3edff4a07f9f956","id":"7d5bf29ee3c745cdaf29003abd982b0b"},{"type":"Edge","source_node_id":"4714693e19b843dfa3edff4a07f9f956","target_node_id":"1075fc19c99447d3b0e46f6f472f3551","id":"bda4250bd7b04e888bd1e449bbc83194"}],"id":"primary"}],"script_variables":[{"type":"String","name":"badge_type","value":{"type":"String","mode":"string"},"list":false,"id":"898ebfdb07e44829b2edae05dab6d191","formatType":"text","secure":false,"sensitive":false,"aiInput":false},{"type":"String","name":"user_location","value":{"type":"String","mode":"string"},"list":false,"id":"9f4e090382b3443cafb42a9100937dff","formatType":"text","secure":false,"sensitive":false,"aiInput":false},{"type":"String","name":"location_mobile_cred_enabled","value":{"type":"String","mode":"string"},"list":false,"id":"5b0ff1a970234d7eb50c5402f618366d","formatType":"text","secure":false,"sensitive":false,"aiInput":false},{"type":"String","name":"default_status","value":{"type":"String","mode":"string"},"list":false,"id":"4ecb45bc968349f794d0e1ea03b7d661","formatType":"text","secure":false,"sensitive":false,"aiInput":false},{"type":"String","name":"default_system","value":{"type":"String","mode":"string"},"list":false,"id":"fca3cca234ff40da9a23e9194f4d6a2c","formatType":"text","secure":false,"sensitive":false,"aiInput":false},{"type":"String","name":"default_access","value":{"type":"String","mode":"string"},"list"